# Pin line endings. A shell script checked out with CRLF fails on Linux with a
# confusing "bad interpreter" error, and CMake/C++ sources should not churn
# between platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cpp text eol=lf
*.hpp text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
CMakeLists.txt text eol=lf
